@harleyfoote_ But then we spend the rest of the time talking about all the good things AI is going to do. 

It's a new problem: how do you encourage something that's becoming smarter than you are? (And when I say "you," I mean humanity in total.) And you are hoping that it decides we're cool. 

I don't know. We're going to have to put on a show for the AI, which is our new job.

@pranjalsoni_ True but I think a product should be able to sell itself organically, as I did that for the last 13 years

I don't see want to have to pump it by UGC and ads to make it work

If it's good enough it should be able to sell itself
